60000 REM joydefs.bas - canonical gamepad button-bit names for IE64 BASIC
60001 REM IE64 BASIC variable names cannot contain '_', so these use the
60002 REM JOYxxx form (JOYA, JOYHOME, ...). MERGE this file, then GOSUB 60000
60003 REM once before using PAD(n), e.g.
60004 REM   MERGE "joydefs.bas" : GOSUB 60000
60005 REM   IF PAD(0) AND JOYA THEN ...
60006 REM Bit values match the canonical gamepad MMIO layout (input_gamepad.go).
60010 JOYUP=1
60011 JOYDOWN=2
60012 JOYLEFT=4
60013 JOYRIGHT=8
60014 JOYA=16
60015 JOYB=32
60016 JOYX=64
60017 JOYY=128
60018 JOYLB=256
60019 JOYRB=512
60020 JOYLT=1024
60021 JOYRT=2048
60022 JOYSELECT=4096
60023 JOYSTART=8192
60024 JOYL3=16384
60025 JOYR3=32768
60026 JOYHOME=65536
60027 RETURN
